{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.099747470137076188,"c":1,"w":0.43702987670898436,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.19145693242978085,"h":0.04129274580510367},{"y":0.16721228095904916,"w":0.24800621032714842,"t":"Additional sample Writing answers","c":1,"h":0.020138255360244939,"x":0.26442393064366132},{"c":1,"t":"in Resource Bank","x":0.26297578082694095,"w":0.13148788452148441,"y":0.18894331706858347,"h":0.013091566514268127},{"c":1,"y":0.23967809596159073,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 1","x":0.19204152329204344,"w":0.30449826558430987,"h":0.02485678761550969},{"x":0.19204152353996942,"y":0.28052325584197557,"h":0.018986890831554248,"w":0.60034601847330726,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 5.5 score."},{"t":"The graph shows how changes are occupations in four different kind of jobs in the US","x":0.19204152177527778,"h":0.020411899158218727,"c":1,"w":0.69204152425130205,"y":0.30813953519839221},{"x":0.19031141584676764,"h":0.016095171448565315,"w":0.16262976328531903,"t":"from 1960 to 2020.","c":1,"y":0.33135059495235364},{"x":0.19031140944279676,"h":0.018968582820692137,"c":1,"w":0.69723185221354156,"t":"In 1960, the number of Manufacturing is the highest in these four sectors, 15 millions,","y":0.36039188226207963},{"w":0.70934254964192711,"y":0.38068579410343117,"t":"and the second highest is Retail and Agriculture as a same number (5 million). I can see","h":0.01902350818802212,"x":0.19204152783921244,"c":1},{"t":"the hugh gap between highest number of occupations and second's in 1960. Moreover,","y":0.39827178382018402,"w":0.70609451293945313,"h":0.024748391751395427,"x":0.19021919235587642,"c":1},{"h":0.01749882054045282,"c":1,"x":0.19204151861662089,"y":0.4244186043684437,"t":"Healthcare is lowest number at approximately 2.5 million.","w":0.4757785542805989},{"x":0.19199948893363408,"w":0.68174799601236968,"t":"Firstly, the number of healthcare increace dramatically rather than the other three","y":0.45194480787742752,"h":0.02000792031525056,"c":1},{"x":0.19022709090537879,"t":"sectors. People who work as a healthcare had grown more than six times in 60 years,","w":0.69396870930989585,"c":1,"y":0.47093045414371626,"h":0.023295654126027743},{"y":0.49563953455517296,"w":0.6885813395182292,"h":0.020455636704526881,"c":1,"x":0.19031140628073123,"t":"which is the highest number in 2020 with Retail sector. Furthermore, the number of"},{"h":0.019042161230109933,"y":0.51542004055116786,"x":0.19178731465772672,"w":0.18910680135091143,"t":"Retail is also great rise.","c":1},{"x":0.19031142977256488,"y":0.54505813920601731,"t":"Manufacturing was most common jobs in 1960, however these declined from 15 million","w":0.71107264200846365,"h":0.02037223191257953,"c":1},{"x":0.19010507798828258,"w":0.17347661336263021,"y":0.56638324052844868,"t":"to 13 million in 2020.","h":0.018018619758921051,"c":1},{"y":0.59587123892070826,"w":0.66955017089843749,"h":0.018954342441011574,"c":1,"t":"In addition, Agriculture was third highest in 1960 and had decreased 6 million to 2","x":0.18858131585262508},{"h":0.019063176101033252,"t":"million, which is the lowest in 2020.","y":0.61756473083861418,"w":0.29238754272460932,"x":0.19031141886538142,"c":1},{"x":0.19031142088009537,"y":0.64680232560991646,"h":0.019047919314086226,"w":0.70069203694661464,"c":1,"t":"To sum up, it can be seen that the economy in the US changed significantly in 60 years"},{"w":0.58823527018229171,"y":0.66715116246171657,"x":0.19031143056551419,"c":1,"t":"from 1960 to 2020, and at the same time occupations had been altered.","h":0.020392574740090152},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.27162630716959635,"c":1,"x":0.19031141375649477,"y":0.70494186022511662,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:"},{"x":0.23183391354556818,"w":0.66262975056966145,"t":"This response is a good attempt at the task. It does include the main information","h":0.017494751574527734,"y":0.72673198020154961,"c":1},{"x":0.22837370277302133,"w":0.65397923787434897,"h":0.018908571412798558,"y":0.74562631227450271,"c":1,"t":"in the line chart but there are some details missing, for example, manufacturing"},{"t":"[declined from 15 million to 13 million] with no mention of the peak in 1980 at","y":0.76036983676686221,"w":0.64551884969075513,"h":0.022328480212650104,"c":1,"x":0.22828079563014864},{"w":0.090797735850016242,"x":0.22972515283604936,"h":0.015834628159220654,"c":1,"y":0.78134442279659888,"t":"20 million."},{"x":0.23010380909996628,"t":"There is an attempt at an overview in the final paragraph, [To sum up, it can be","y":0.80813953491120982,"c":1,"w":0.64705881754557293,"h":0.019012319699628466},{"t":"seen that the economy in the US changed significantly in 60 years from 1960 to","h":0.017611722499027871,"c":1,"x":0.23010380085455334,"y":0.82703488343855802,"w":0.65224914550781254},{"h":0.017610705424389472,"c":1,"y":0.84593023227629704,"w":0.65051905314127612,"x":0.2318338989429865,"t":"2020, and at the same time occupations had been altered.] However, this is too"},{"t":"generic. An overview needs to summarise the main changes that have occurred.","x":0.23005856152529816,"w":0.65928243001302089,"c":1,"y":0.86208142665133547,"h":0.020793394244910113},{"t":"Ideas are presented coherently. There are some nice examples of cohesive","x":0.23010379636147851,"y":0.88943316996589905,"h":0.017543574494027547,"c":1,"w":0.61245676676432292},{"h":0.017544591568665835,"t":"devices [Moreover | Firstly | In addition | To sum up]but some overuse","x":0.23010379520359778,"y":0.90832750173052157,"w":0.58131490071614578,"c":1},{"x":0.2283737020272856,"t":"[Furthermore | however].","y":0.92722183317587137,"w":0.2076124572753906,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1},{"w":0.031141869227091501,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"x":0.87716262931887856,"t":"125","y":0.95494186055080377}],"h":2857}